{"id":"n58299-1-13","stage":2,"title":"구하다 · 找","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58299-1-13-1","ko":"교재 구했어? 도서관에 없던데.","zh":"找到教材了吗？图书馆里好像没有啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"교재","meaning":"教材","explanation":"교재：教材","readings":[{"term":"교재","audio":"/audio/bb71cc9a2a3c8aa05982.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24069","senseId":"1","lemma":"교재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교재","audio":"/audio/bb71cc9a2a3c8aa05982.mp3"}},{"text":"구했어?","meaning":"找，弄，求","explanation":"구하다：找，弄，求；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"구하다","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58299","senseId":"1","lemma":"구하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구했어","audio":"/audio/47ea67fcc257393d0cb5.mp3"}},{"text":"도서관에","meaning":"图书馆","explanation":"도서관：图书馆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"도서관","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40295","senseId":"1","lemma":"도서관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도서관에","audio":"/audio/5f81e45a6e4a14c4ae9e.mp3"}},{"text":"없던데.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없던데","audio":"/audio/d017f85a1947a98723db.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bb71cc9a2a3c8aa0","term":"교재","zh":"教材","audio":"/audio/bb71cc9a2a3c8aa05982.mp3","entryId":"24069","definition":"教育或学习时所需的教科书或其他材料。","pronunciation":["교ː재"]},{"id":"288eb4bbfc0c27cc","term":"구하다","zh":"找，弄，求","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3","entryId":"58299","definition":"为得到需要的东西而寻找；或指寻找以求得到。","pronunciation":["구하다"]},{"id":"9ee22c8536d3503a","term":"도서관","zh":"图书馆","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3","entryId":"40295","definition":"